Otegami depends on the third-party open source software listed below,
pulled in via Swift Package Manager (either directly by
packages/OtegamiKit/Package.swift and server/otegami-relay/Package.swift,
or transitively). None of it is vendored into this repository; SwiftPM
fetches and builds it from source at the pinned revisions recorded in the
Package.resolved files. This file exists for attribution, and to satisfy
the notice-reproduction requirement of the Apache License, Version 2.0
(section 4(d)) for the dependencies below that use it.

